      "created_at": "2022-04-05T17:57:36.987Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don’t think anything has been moved; rather, Android updates have made the default file manager useless for this purpose by eliminating its ability to display files within the Android folder. I use a third party file manager on my phone, and can locate the log file right where it always has been.</p>",
