      "created_at": "2022-04-07T15:37:29.655Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, me not being willing to grant total blanket permission to an unfamiliar app is why I ever posted this thread.  If I was willing to take a risk like that, I would have just used the first app I downloaded back when I first noticed this problem.  But I only want to be able to read the file, not delete it, so none of the apps I’ve tried were acceptable.</p>",
