      "username": "doppelgangerung",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/doppelgangerung/{size}/1876_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-04-07T19:40:58.405Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I understand your reluctance to grant such rights to some app you found online; the only option I can offer is to find such an app that you can trust, whether by reputation or what have you, so you can give it the necessary capability. The Android updates seem to have stripped their natives apps of the ability to access those folders no matter what permissions are given to them.</p>",
